        "original_id": "df2b8f13-6b0c-5a8d-a7d1-9d5e14b4b777",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: University of the Philippines, The NorthCap University, Ateneo de Manila University\n- People: Nicanor Tiongson, Ryan Cayabyab\n- Places: Philippines, Gurugram, Haryana, India\n- Concepts: state university system, autonomous university, Philippine Studies\n- Works: ASEAN Song of Unity\n\nFacts:\n- The University of the Philippines is a state university system in the Philippines.\n- The NorthCap University, formerly ITM University, is an autonomous university in Sector 23-A, Gurugram, Haryana, India.\n- Nicanor Tiongson earned a Bachelor of Humanities degree from the Ateneo de Manila University.\n- Nicanor Tiongson earned M.A. and Ph.D. degrees in Philippine Studies from the University of the Philippines.\n- Nicanor Tiongson wrote the lyrics for the ASEAN Song of Unity.\n- Ryan Cayabyab composed the music for the ASEAN Song of Unity.",
